---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="San Francisco Wrongful Death Attorney | The Sulfab Law Office"
  description="Lost a loved one due to negligence in San Francisco? Sulfab Law Office helps families pursue wrongful death claims. Call (415) 360-5266 for a free consultation."
>
  <section class="relative bg-dark pt-28 pb-32 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img src="/assets/images/hero-wrongful-death.webp" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center" loading="eager" />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-dark/95 via-dark/80 to-slate-900/60"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-dark/20"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mb-8"></div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Personal Injury</span>
        <h1 class="text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">San Francisco Wrongful Death Lawyer</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xl md:text-2xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-10">Losing a loved one is the hardest experience one can have in their life. While no amount of money can replace your loved one, a wrongful death lawsuit can provide financial security and hold the responsible party accountable.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white/25 text-white hover:border-gold hover:bg-white/5 transition-all rounded-lg">Free Case Review</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50/50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Losing a loved one is the hardest experience one can have in their life. When that loss happens because another person acted carelessly, the pain can feel even greater. While no amount of money can replace your loved one, a wrongful death lawsuit can provide financial security for your family and hold the responsible party accountable.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">The Sulfab Law Office is there to offer legal assistance at such tough times. If you need a wrongful death lawyer in San Francisco, then you have come to the right place. Call (415) 360-5266 for a free case review.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Understanding</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Understanding a Wrongful Death Claim</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">A wrongful death lawsuit is initiated when someone passes away due to the negligence, recklessness, or intent of another person. California laws allow eligible individuals the opportunity to sue for the losses resulting from the wrongful death of a loved one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Car or truck accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Motorcycle or pedestrian accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Medical malpractice</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Construction or workplace accidents</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Dangerous property conditions</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-sm">!</span>
          <span class="text-slate-700 text-sm font-medium">Defective products</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm text-center mt-6">A wrongful death attorney in San Francisco can assist you in understanding your rights.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Support</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">How We Help Your Family</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">In case of a sudden death, handling the insurance companies and paperwork might be a stressful process. Our objective is to reduce the burden of this task.</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">We research the issue thoroughly, collecting all relevant evidence, interviewing witnesses and, where appropriate, talking to specialists. We also handle all communications with the insurance companies for you.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Every case receives personal attention because every family's story is different.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Eligibility</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Who Can File a Wrongful Death Claim</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">In California, however, there are restrictions on who can file a wrongful death lawsuit. For instance, those who can file in most cases include the following:</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-6">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold mt-2 shrink-0"></span> Surviving spouse or a registered domestic partner</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold mt-2 shrink-0"></span> Children of the deceased</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold mt-2 shrink-0"></span> Grandchildren in certain situations</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-600"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold mt-2 shrink-0"></span> Other qualified dependents when immediate family members are not available</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">There is also a time limit imposed by the law, which requires that the claim be filed within two years after the death of the individual. Failure to meet this deadline may result in losing the right to recover compensation for your family. Some exceptions, including claims against government entities, may have much shorter deadlines.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Contact our wrongful death attorney promptly to determine eligibility and ensure your claim is filed within the applicable time frame.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-slate-50/50 border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Financial Recovery</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Compensation Your Family May Recover</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">The purpose of filing for a wrongful death lawsuit is to reduce any financial pressure that may be placed on your family after such a terrible experience. The amount of compensation depends on the circumstances surrounding the case and includes:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Medical & Funeral Expenses</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Medical expenses resulting from the injury or illness that caused the death, plus funeral and burial costs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Lost Income & Support</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Wages and any financial support lost, plus loss of household services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-100">
          <div class="inline-flex w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 text-gold items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Loss of Companionship</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Loss of love, companionship, care, and guidance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[5fr_7fr] gap-16 items-start">
        <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">Why Trust Us</span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Why Families Trust The Sulfab Law Office</h2>
          <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-gold rounded-full"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Families choose our firm because we combine compassionate support with strong legal representation. To us, it's not another case; it's about protecting your loved one's memory and your family's future.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/50 border border-gold/20">
            <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium">When you hire us, you receive clear communication, honest advice, and dedicated legal support from start to finish.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-gold text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6">FAQ</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-dark mb-6 italic font-serif">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Is an unmarried partner allowed to file for a wrongful death lawsuit?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">The unmarried partner will need to be a registered domestic partner or meet a limited legal exception.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Do parents or siblings qualify to file for a wrongful death case in California?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Parents or siblings can file for such a lawsuit under certain conditions. The California wrongful death law provides guidelines on who is qualified to pursue the lawsuit. Generally, it is parents or siblings who can apply for the suit in cases where the decedent had no living domestic partner, child, or spouse.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">How is compensation divided when several family members file a claim?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">In cases where there is more than one family member who is eligible to make a claim, the compensation could be shared according to the decision made by the family members. If they fail to arrive at a decision, then the court could decide on how to distribute the amount.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-100">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-dark mb-2">Are wrongful death settlements taxable?</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">The award of compensatory damages is not taxable, but punitive damages might be taxable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-dark border-t border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 italic font-serif">Take Your First Step Toward Justice for Your Loved One</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">If your loved one's life was taken due to another's negligence, you are not alone in your journey. The Sulfab Law Office is ready to answer your questions, explain your legal options and fight for the compensation your family deserves. Call our office at (415) 360-5266 today. Let us help you understand your legal options with a free consultation.</p>
      <a href="tel:+14153605266" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-gold text-white font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-xs hover:bg-amber-600 transition-all rounded-lg">Call (415) 360-5266</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
